id=r1_lockscreen_overlay
name=R1 Lockscreen (SystemUI + pattern overlays)
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=recovery
description=Retunes the keyguard for the R1's 480x640 panel via two RROs: a SystemUI overlay (smaller clock, tighter gutters) and a framework overlay (slimmer, recoloured pattern grid). Also hides lockscreen notifications. Pairs with the mascot lock wallpaper (tools/make-lock-wallpaper.py). Reboot after install/remove.
